AWS Client VPN SAML patch for OpenVPN 2.7.8.

Derived from AWS's openvpn-2.6.12-aws-1 source drop (via upstream
aws-vpn-client), ported to v2.7.8. Unlike the AWS original, the
enlarged size macros are parenthesized: unparenthesized, expressions
such as OPTION_PARM_SIZE + 16 expand to 1 << 33 (undefined behaviour).
In 2.7, write_string() also caps strings at UINT16_MAX; with 32-bit
length fields that cap is lifted so long SAML passwords still fit.

